farcli carries two things inside its program that are other people's work.
Neither is covered by farcli's MIT licence (the file LICENSE). Each keeps its
own terms, which are in the folder named.

Microsoft's hidden terminal: conpty.dll and OpenConsole.exe
    Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. From the Windows Terminal project,
    package Microsoft.Windows.Console.ConPTY 1.25.261109001, unchanged.
    farcli unpacks the two files, with Microsoft's licence beside them, to
    %LOCALAPPDATA%\farcli\hidden-terminal and runs Target apps on them.
    Terms and where the files came from: assets/hidden-terminal

The font Vazir Code WOL
    By Saber Rastikerdar. Setup installs it for the current user.
    Terms and where the file came from: assets/vazir-code
